  hearMoreName: EnvironmentalHearMore04
  hearMoreText: "Software design influences real-world behavior \u2014 for instance,
    a logistics app can cut emissions through route optimization or worsen them by
    encouraging faster, more frequent deliveries. Thoughtful design helps steer users
    toward more sustainable actions."
